  "description": {
   "en": "Searching for the woman he once loved, a young vampire named Zach visits an old house in a quiet town in Japan, where he finds an old woman and her granddaughter living. Zach has a different sense of time and values than humans do, but as he stays with them, he gets to know them and begins to unravel the strange life of the woman he cares for. \n\n(First chap currently being worked on by Oil Ocean Scans, note will be deleted upon upload)"
